  (text "Intercom carrier, rev A, 2026-10-06 (Intercom boerderij)\nPlugs onto header P6 of the Waveshare ESP32-P4-WIFI6-POE-ETH. All parts through-hole.\nESPHome: buttons GPIO22/20/21/23 INPUT_PULLUP, inverted (pressed = low). LEDs GPIO32/33/4/5 via LEDC (PWM), active high.\nButton connectors (JST-XH): 1 = LED+ (+5V), 2 = LED-, 3 = switch, 4 = GND.\nR13-R16: fit 0R, or a resistor once the ring current at 5 V is measured."
    (at 12.7 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c2a6229d-2606-4fef-8bed-f1c6215b6424")
  )
